{{Quote|Hang on! This is gonna be a bumpy ride.|Fasttrack to [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] as they attach to him.<ref name="EoMF">''[[Enemy of My Frenemy]]''</ref>}}
'''Fasttrack''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Citrakayah]] from the planet [[Chalybeas]].{{Refn|[[:File:Fasttrack's Name Revealed.png]]|group = PAD|name = revelation}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Fasttrack===
Fasttrack is a feline-like alien with a black suit-like color scheme, and his hands, legs, chest, and part of his head are colored blue. He has black mask-like fins around his green eyes, a triangle-shaped nose, a thunderbolt-like design down his chest, and a triangle one down his back. He also has spike-like blades on his arms and legs.

Fasttrack wears the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

===Albedo as Negative Fasttrack===
[[Albedo|Negative]] Fasttrack looks just like [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Fasttrack, but with red eyes and no Ultimatrix symbol.

