==Games==
===Video Games===
[[File:Fasttrack GR.png|Fasttrack in ''Galactic Racing''|thumb]]
====[[Ben 10: Galactic Racing]]====
Fasttrack is a playable racer in the game. His attack special ability is to unleash several small tornadoes, which fly forward in a row and topple racers from behind. His defense special ability is to become intangible by flipping and dodging. 

Fasttrack is able to move fast enough to get through any attack. In his own words, he becomes intangible. In addition to being able to perform a "Spinjitzu" by spinning at high speed and creating mini tornadoes that affect enemies, he can increase his speed if he stores enough kinetic energy.

===Online Games===
[[File:Fasttrack SHT.png|thumb|Fasttrack in ''Super Hero Time'']]
====[[Super Hero Time]]====
Fasttrack is a playable alien in the game. He can only be unlocked by earning the We Love Gumball Badge in ''Cartoon Network Game On''.

